sentences.text:
The challenge of the appellants to the Impugned Award is on the following aspects:-
a) That the learned Tribunal has erred in granting future prospects on the income of the deceased only to the extent of 30%;
b) That the learned Tribunal has erred in not granting compensation on account of loss of consortium;
c) That the learned Tribunal has erred in restricting the compensation on account of loss of estate and funeral expenses to Rs.10,000/- each.

